> NicQuid Bahama Blizzard will rival any frozen tropical cocktail. Better than sitting on a beach with a breeze in your hair. It is a perfect paring of orange, cranberry and peach which is blended and frozen with cool sweet menthol.[ Nic]Quip: The basic recipe for a Daiquirí is also similar to the g[rog] British sailors were rationed aboard ship from the 1740s onwards. You may also have to ration[ Nic]Quid Bahama Blizzard before you vape it all up!

